# NOTE: state/history_deep, state/history, state/intraday are now COMMITTED so the repo
# is self-contained for Vercel (which serves the checkout, not an Actions-built _site).
# They're regenerated + re-committed each cycle by the refresh tasks (git add -A). Deltas
# are tiny (deep history only appends the latest bar), so history bloat stays modest.
logs/
# Anchored to the repo root ON PURPOSE. This ignores the terminal's Vercel build
# output (root vercel.json does `mkdir -p public`). An unanchored `public/` also
# matches site/public/, which silently kept robots.txt, favicon.svg and the OG
# image out of the marketing build — they 404'd on the live site.
/public/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.tmp
.venv/
# never commit secrets
.env
*.key
# .github/workflows/ IS tracked now (the gh token needs 'workflow' scope to push it;
# it currently lives on GitHub via the web UI — keep the two in sync manually)
